chezmoi dots audit — Audit live shell and secrets configuration

USAGE
  chezmoi dots audit [<check>...]

ARGUMENTS
  check  aliases: detect unmanaged live shell aliases in the available zsh and bash interactive shells; secrets: probe the CLIs declared in .chezmoidata/secrets.toml (bws, bw, rbw) read-only, never printing a secret (default: all checks).
  Checks are arguments, not subcommands.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).
  XDG_CONFIG_HOME  config directory (default: ~/.config).
  Reads shell/aliases.sh and shell/omz-aliases.zsh there, and ~/.oh-my-zsh/plugins.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots audit
  chezmoi dots audit aliases
  chezmoi dots audit secrets
